  "question": {
    "text": "At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>, the vapour pressure of benzene is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>70</mn></math> torr and that of methyl benzene is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> torr. The mole fraction of benzene in the vapour phase at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;above an equimolar mixture of benzene and methyl benzene is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> (Nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "78",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>70</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>70</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
